    "title": "CUBE Consultants Signs Strategic Memorandum of Understanding with Hunan Chamber of Commerce in Egypt to Strengthen Egyptian-Chinese Cooperation",
    "slug": "cube-consultants-signs-strategic-memorandum-of-understanding-with-hunan-chamber-of-commerce-in-egypt-to-strengthen-egyptian-chinese-cooperation",
    "date": "June 11, 2026",
    "rawDate": "2026-06-11T16:42:21",
    "excerpt": "CUBE Consultants for Engineering and Urban Development has signed a strategic Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with the Hunan Chamber of Commerce in Egypt (HNCCE) during the Egypt-China Economic and Trade Cooperation Forum and the Chamber’s official launch ceremony in Cairo.   The event was attended by a distinguished group of officials and representatives from Egyptian ...",
    "image": "/assets/insights/cube-consultants-signs-strategic-memorandum-of-understanding-with-hunan-chamber-of-commerce-in-egypt-to-strengthen-egyptian-chinese-cooperation/file_00000000f41c71fba10a28c4e9d50810.webp",
    "content": "<h4>CUBE Consultants for Engineering and Urban Development has signed a strategic Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with the Hunan Chamber of Commerce in Egypt (HNCCE) during the Egypt-China Economic and Trade Cooperation Forum and the Chamber’s official launch ceremony in Cairo.</h4><h4> </h4><h4 data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\" data-pen-placeholder=\"Type Here...\">The event was attended by a distinguished group of officials and representatives from Egyptian and Chinese economic and investment institutions.</h4><h4 data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\" data-pen-placeholder=\"Type Here...\">Dr. Heba Soliman, Chief Executive Officer of CUBE Consultants, signed the MoU on behalf of the company as part of CUBE’s ongoing efforts to expand its international partnership network and strengthen cooperation with leading economic and investment organizations worldwide. </h4><h4 data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\" data-pen-placeholder=\"Type Here...\">The Memorandum of Understanding aims to establish a shared platform for cooperation and knowledge exchange in the fields of urban planning, architectural design, engineering consultancy, and real estate development. It also seeks to support investment opportunities, foster collaboration in international projects, and facilitate the exchange of technical and professional expertise between both parties. </h4><h4 data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\" data-pen-placeholder=\"Type Here...\">Under the agreement, CUBE Consultants will join the network of accredited consulting firms affiliated with the Hunan Chamber of Commerce in Egypt. </h4><h4 data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\" data-pen-placeholder=\"Type Here...\">The company will also provide specialized training programs, professional lectures, and technical consultancy services to chamber members and affiliated companies, contributing to enhanced knowledge sharing and professional development between Egypt and China. </h4><h4 data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\" data-pen-placeholder=\"Type Here...\">Dr. Heba Soliman emphasized that this partnership represents an important step toward creating new opportunities for cooperation between both sides and reflects CUBE’s strong professional standing as one of the leading firms in urban planning and engineering consultancy in Egypt and the region. </h4><h4 data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\" data-pen-placeholder=\"Type Here...\">She added that the company looks forward to leveraging this partnership to support joint development and investment projects, facilitate the transfer of expertise and knowledge, and expand cooperation opportunities in sustainable urban development, smart cities, and infrastructure projects. </h4><h4 data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\" data-pen-placeholder=\"Type Here...\">This agreement comes amid the growing relations between the Arab Republic of Egypt and the People's Republic of China, which continue to witness significant expansion in trade, investment, and development cooperation, further strengthening economic ties between the two countries.</h4> <figure ><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/assets/insights/cube-consultants-signs-strategic-memorandum-of-understanding-with-hunan-chamber-of-commerce-in-egypt-to-strengthen-egyptian-chinese-cooperation/DSC02019-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"DSC02019\" /></figure><figure ><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/assets/insights/cube-consultants-signs-strategic-memorandum-of-understanding-with-hunan-chamber-of-commerce-in-egypt-to-strengthen-egyptian-chinese-cooperation/DSC02154-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"DSC02154\" /></figure><figure ><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/assets/insights/cube-consultants-signs-strategic-memorandum-of-understanding-with-hunan-chamber-of-commerce-in-egypt-to-strengthen-egyptian-chinese-cooperation/DSC02021-1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"DSC02021\" /></figure> <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg> <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>",
