    "rawDate": "2021-04-04T23:18:36",
    "excerpt": "The Ancient Egyptian's Golden Parade; Such an event is not only impressive, but also shines a light on all Egyptians' hearts. We here at CUBE are profoundly proud as are we all as a nation. This event marks the day this great country returned to its former glory once more. 2021 will be the turn ...",
