    "content": "<p>The Ancient Egyptian's Golden Parade; Such an event is not only impressive, but also shines a light on all Egyptians' hearts.</p><p>We here at CUBE are profoundly proud as are we all as a nation. This event marks the day this great country returned to its former glory once more. 2021 will be the turn of the century for Egypt's history.</p><p>We're sure the great kings and queens that were transported to The Great Museum in Fustat have restored their faith in us. Let's prove to them their faith has not been misplaced.</p><p>The Royal Car Designed by: Mohamed Attia</p>Image created by Seif Ashraf04.04.2021",
