    "content": "<p >By: <a href=\"http://archafrica.com/author/arch/\">ArchAfrica </a>January 8, 2019</p> <p lang=\"en-US\" align=\"justify\">Throughout the ages, Egypt has been known for its breathtaking scenes of ingenious architectural Consulting firms there . Like their predecessors, the present generations of Egyptian architects are striving to propagate the tradition of awe-inspiring edifices and spectacular architecture.</p> <p lang=\"en-US\" align=\"justify\">The real estate industry of Egypt is enjoying flourishing times that’s opening up more opportunities than ever for Egyptian architects to showcase their craftsmanship. Today, there are wads of spectacular real estate developments scattered across the country designed and built by Egyptian architects. The following is a list of the top 15 architecture studios in Egypt currently bearing the torch of architectural distinction passed down through uncounted generations in Egypt.</p> <p lang=\"en-US\" align=\"justify\">CUBE Consultants was selected to be one of the top Architectural Studios in Egypt</p> <a href=\"http://archafrica.com/2019/01/08/top-15-architectural-studios-in-egypt/\">http://archafrica.com/2019/01/08/top-15-architectural-studios-in-egypt/</a>",
